  1396	Monteiro are doctoral students at the Centre for Informatics of
  1397	the Federal University of Pernambuco where they receive scholar-ship from CNPq and CAPES respectively. The authors would like to
  1398	thank the Samsung Institute for Development of Informatics (Sam-
  1399	sung/SIDI), for partially supporting the work developed in this re-
  1400	search. Finally, the authors would like to thank the reviewers of the
  1401	manuscript for important critiques and comments that lead to sev-
  1402	eral improvements in the ﬁnal article.
